# Execution Log: pub

Chronological change journal, first-class alongside status.md. One entry per line in append order; format:

`[ISO-8601-UTC] [Agent] VERB (I-NNNNNN): description`

Uppercase verb tags record the kind of change (INITIALIZE, BACKFILL, FEATURE, FIX, MIGRATE, ADOPT, ...); the `(I-NNNNNN)` issue reference is optional. Append entries; never rewrite or reorder history.

